 "about": "Wall unit modelled as a generic product: carcass with sloped dust-shedding top, aluminium-framed glazed leaves with D-pulls, 2 shelves, pelmet with LED under-light. Back at y = 0; underside at the Default Elevation. Geometry is drawn at the 900_Glazed type; the other types share it until a parametric pass. Reference: query: casework clinical wall unit glazed casework hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=casework+clinical+wall+unit+glazed+casework+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
